{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "被买走的顺序",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 119.46,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先说一个词：MEV，最大可提取价值。",
   "spoken": "先说一个词：MEV，最大可提取价值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 5.881
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "它指的是，区块生产者或者搜索者，通过安排交易顺序、插入或排除交易，拿到的额外收益。",
   "spoken": "它指的是，区块生产者或者搜索者，通过安排交易顺序、插入或排除交易，拿到的额外收益。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 6.3,
   "dur": 8.88,
   "speechStart": 6.3,
   "speechEnd": 14.974
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "搜索者，是专门寻找这类机会，把交易捆成一组提交的人或程序。",
   "spoken": "搜索者，是专门寻找这类机会，把交易捆成一组提交的人或程序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 15.4,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 15.4,
   "speechEnd": 20.996
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "搜索者把捆绑包交给区块构建者，构建者再把整个区块，卖给提议者。",
   "spoken": "搜索者把捆绑包交给区块构建者，构建者再把整个区块，卖给提议者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 21.38,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 21.38,
   "speechEnd": 27.474
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "这叫提议者与构建者分离。结果是，排序权可以被购买。",
   "spoken": "这叫提议者与构建者分离。结果是，排序权可以被购买。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 27.92,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 27.92,
   "speechEnd": 33.261
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "MEV 有三种形态。",
   "spoken": "MEV 有三种形态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 33.66,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 33.759,
   "speechEnd": 35.35
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "第一种，抢跑：攻击者排在你前面。",
   "spoken": "第一种，抢跑：攻击者排在你前面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 35.8,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 35.8,
   "speechEnd": 39.329
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "比如一道谜题，第一个提交答案的人领奖。机器人复制你的答案，出更高的小费，先成交。",
   "spoken": "比如一道谜题，第一个提交答案的人领奖。机器人复制你的答案，出更高的小费，先成交。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 39.78,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 39.873,
   "speechEnd": 47.26
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "第二种，三明治：攻击者先买，你再买，攻击者最后卖。",
   "spoken": "第二种，三明治：攻击者先买，你再买，攻击者最后卖。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 47.68,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 47.776,
   "speechEnd": 53.173
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "他利用的，是你设定的滑点容忍度。",
   "spoken": "他利用的，是你设定的滑点容忍度。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 53.58,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 53.58,
   "speechEnd": 56.664
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "第三种，尾随：攻击者排在你后面，吃掉你的交易留下的套利或清算机会。",
   "spoken": "第三种，尾随：攻击者排在你后面，吃掉你的交易留下的套利或清算机会。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 57.08,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 57.18,
   "speechEnd": 64.04
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "尾随通常没有直接的受害者。",
   "spoken": "尾随通常没有直接的受害者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 64.5,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 64.591,
   "speechEnd": 66.607
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "回到三明治，拆开看。",
   "spoken": "回到三明治，拆开看。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 67.04,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 67.04,
   "speechEnd": 68.572
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "你的交易进入公开内存池。",
   "spoken": "你的交易进入公开内存池。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 69.02,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 69.115,
   "speechEnd": 70.923
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "搜索者发现它，捆成一包：自己买入，你的交易，自己卖出。",
   "spoken": "搜索者发现它，捆成一包：自己买入，你的交易，自己卖出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 71.4,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 71.491,
   "speechEnd": 76.27
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "构建者按这个顺序打包。",
   "spoken": "构建者按这个顺序打包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 76.66,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 76.764,
   "speechEnd": 78.412
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "搜索者先买，把价格推高。",
   "spoken": "搜索者先买，把价格推高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 78.8,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 78.8,
   "speechEnd": 81.035
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "你按更坏的价格成交，刚好满足最小输出。",
   "spoken": "你按更坏的价格成交，刚好满足最小输出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 81.42,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 81.513,
   "speechEnd": 85.132
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "搜索者再卖回去，赚走中间的利润。",
   "spoken": "搜索者再卖回去，赚走中间的利润。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 85.56,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 85.56,
   "speechEnd": 88.631
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "他最多能赚多少，由你的最小输出决定。滑点设得越宽，被夹得越狠。",
   "spoken": "他最多能赚多少，由你的最小输出决定。滑点设得越宽，被夹得越狠。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 89.06,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 89.06,
   "speechEnd": 95.311
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "打个比方。你在拍卖会上举牌之前，大声说出了自己的最高出价。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。你在拍卖会上举牌之前，大声说出了自己的最高出价。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-20.wav",
   "start": 95.76,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 95.859,
   "speechEnd": 100.872
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "旁边的人抢先用低一点的价格买下，再加价转卖给你。",
   "spoken": "旁边的人抢先用低一点的价格买下，再加价转卖给你。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-21.wav",
   "start": 101.26,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 101.26,
   "speechEnd": 105.955
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立：拍卖会上，你能看到谁插了队。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立：拍卖会上，你能看到谁插了队。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-22.wav",
   "start": 106.36,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 106.458,
   "speechEnd": 110.247
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "链上的三明治，和你的交易在同一个区块里。普通用户往往只看到，成交价比预期低。",
   "spoken": "链上的三明治，和你的交易在同一个区块里。普通用户往往只看到，成交价比预期低。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg2-23.wav",
   "start": 110.66,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 110.755,
   "speechEnd": 118.028
  }
 ],
